<center>

In the <a style="text-decoration:none; color: silver" href="https://play.pokemonshowdown.com/gamecorner">PS! Game Corner</a> chat room, when a user plays a Pokemon card in certain games, there is a small chance for the Pokemon to be shiny. If we combine our luck, will we be able to collect every shiny Pokemon?

<br><br>Let's try to take a screenshot of every shiny Pokemon card as a community!

